  "contentHtml": "<p>1. AI도구를 활용하여 어려운 개념 (TCA 회로) 을 &#39;과학동화&#39;로 만듭니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/32fd771bd29ce5b5ea8bcfe5f860306d58ce62fe\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"576\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/32fd771bd29ce5b5ea8bcfe5f860306d58ce62fe\" data-origin-width=\"1181\" data-origin-height=\"660\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 좀 더 완벽한 동화를 만들기 위해 오른쪽처럼 다양한 프롬프트를 넣어줍니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/150ff8baffce2acbda40414b3bf8e5e00b614ded\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"700\" height=\"391\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/150ff8baffce2acbda40414b3bf8e5e00b614ded\" data-origin-width=\"1181\" data-origin-height=\"660\"></div><p>3. 이렇게 완성된 동화를 NotebookLM을 활용하여 &#39;팟캐스트&#39;로 제작합니다.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 86.6999%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\">작성 메모 예시 :<br><br>학생들에게 TCA회로 pdf 파일로 수업을 하는데 내용이해를 무척 어려워해서<br>&#39;에너지랜드의 회전목마&#39; pdf파일 처럼<br>과학연극 시나리오를 만들어 보니 어려운 개념을 이해하는데 아주 효과적이네요.<br><br>두명의 교사가<br>회전목마 연극시나리오를 재미있게 읽어주면서<br>TCA회로의 의미를 소개해주는 팟캐스트를 만들어주세요.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8e818987f49c5100e9886be9ca1337843b7fcf9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"700\" height=\"392\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d8e818987f49c5100e9886be9ca1337843b7fcf9\" data-origin-width=\"1179\" data-origin-height=\"660\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvqhhxog62k73gl783fokxvdh@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"300\" data-video-height=\"169\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvs3a8ucbw2xsv0ropsxxel21/thumbs/1.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33304478503&amp;signature=anyl0L6vFdjPnSCNSlD3ThJQscU%3D&amp;ts=1747569703\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvqhhxog62k73gl783fokxvdh?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cWhoeG9nNjJrNzNnbDc4M2Zva3h2ZGgiLCJ0aWQiOiI3MDc2MDVhNC04OTAyLTQzYmEtYjJiOC1jMDE2OTQwYTNkODEiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODg2NDR9.tfco-hpfpMHjPR2IpKzYYSE51P7hFI4MhQg1AOKpbxycUa0UD34-q_kBDHmR-ZMLqhdjMQ12w1bBSHNPEbQjMQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">TCA 회로 과학동화 팟캐스트</div></div><p>4. 팟캐스트 음성에서 텍스트를 추출합니다.</p><p>&#160;1) 새로만들기 - PC에서 오디오 불러오기 : 팟캐스트 wav 파일을 불려옵니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8889b5323aaa36a519c5748e33aacfc6aba00da5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"243\" height=\"211\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8889b5323aaa36a519c5748e33aacfc6aba00da5\" data-origin-width=\"351\" data-origin-height=\"305\"></div><p>&#160;2) &#39;전체 자막 복사하기&#39; 클릭하면 음성이 텍스트로 추출됩니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d29b4920bb0635ca0a40af41079fda1543970b66\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"325\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d29b4920bb0635ca0a40af41079fda1543970b66\" data-origin-width=\"927\" data-origin-height=\"603\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>5. Vrew를 실행한 후 추출한 텍스트를 넣고, 영상을 제작합니다.</p><p>&#160; &#160;(원하는 사진이나 자막을 추가할 수 있습니다.)</p><p>&#160;1) 텍스트로 비디오 만들기 클릭</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a797f129dc4585771a832c29901adcec0d8bf9e2\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" height=\"230\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a797f129dc4585771a832c29901adcec0d8bf9e2\" data-origin-width=\"341\" data-origin-height=\"262\"></div><p>&#160;2) 원하는 사진이나 자막 추가하기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76deae43badbc92797b29bdeb519ab74573d24cc\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"661\" height=\"355\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76deae43badbc92797b29bdeb519ab74573d24cc\" data-origin-width=\"1405\" data-origin-height=\"755\"></div><p>6. 동영상 완성!</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/9mDRLfX1X0g\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/9mDRLfX1X0g</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9mDRLfX1X0g\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"600\" data-video-height=\"337\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b8MwD1/hyYWTmeTf9/8K7uopSiZBvIQ9Ing24Mh1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/brm24E/hyYU4Cqpsw/VlFbHRvgKf3eT7Qu60oAV0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"857\" data-video-origin-height=\"482\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9mDRLfX1X0g\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
